label Call
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	UncleMario: Oh hello? What is it again? You need more stock or are we expanding the store?
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	UncleMario: Uy, [i]anak[/i]! Calling Uncle already? [pause=0.4] Don't worry, I've got you covered. What do you need today?
else:
	UncleMario: Hello? [pause=0.8] [shake rate=20 level=10]Yawn...[/shake] [pause=0.7] Oh, hello anak. I was just about to have my second coffee. Tell me what you need so I can get moving.
- Restock my shelves.
	[signal arg="mario_open_restock"]
	UncleMario: Sige, just send me the list and I'll bring it right over!
- Let's upgrade the store.
	[signal arg="mario_open_upgrade"]
	UncleMario: Oho, expanding already? Let's take a look at the upgrade packages!
- Nevermind, wrong dial!
	[signal arg="mario_cancel_call"]
	UncleMario: Haha, okay lang, [i]anak[/i]! Just call me whenever you need anything.
[end_timeline]

label Busy
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	UncleMario: Oy, aren't you busy right now? Serve that customer first before telling me what you need. Call me back when the counter is clear.
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	UncleMario: Huy! You have a customer waiting, [i]anak[/i]. [pause=0.4] Multi-tasking is good, but don't ignore the people in front of you. Call me later!
else:
	UncleMario: Focus, kid! The customer is waiting. I can hang on, but they might not. I'll stay by the phone, just call again when you're done.
[end_timeline]

label CallRest
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	UncleMario: Anak, I just delivered to you recently... I'm still resting! Serve {Transaction_MarioRestCount} more customer(s) first!
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	UncleMario: Pang-ilan na 'to? I'm currently having my merienda. Give me a few more minutes to breathe, anak. Serve {Transaction_MarioRestCount} more person(s) while I eat.
else:
	UncleMario: Wait lang, I'm recharging. Serve {Transaction_MarioRestCount} more customer(s) while I prep my tricycle and my own energy!
[end_timeline]

label Delivery
set {Variation} = range(1,4).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	UncleMario: Here are the items you requested! I put the items where you can find them!
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	UncleMario: Delivery is here! Everything's stocked up. Stay alert, okay? The night is still young, but don't overwork.
else:
	UncleMario: Alright, here's your order. I've placed the bags near the door. [pause=0.5] Don't work too hard, [i]anak[/i]. See you around!
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label UpgradeCall
UncleMario: Uy, [i]anak[/i]! Good thing you picked up!
UncleMario: I just got a fresh batch of next-tier stock ready to be bought for your store!
UncleMario: Here's what's newly available: {Global_UpgradeItemsList}
UncleMario: I've got the upgrade package ready for you right now — want to take a look?
- Let's check the store upgrades!
	[signal arg="mario_open_upgrade"]
	UncleMario: That's the spirit! Here's what we've got ready.
- Actually, I just need to restock.
	[signal arg="mario_open_restock"]
	UncleMario: No problem, [i]anak[/i]! Send me your restock list instead.
- Maybe later, Uncle.
	[signal arg="mario_cancel_call"]
	UncleMario: Sige, take your time! Just ring me up whenever you're ready to expand.
[end_timeline]

label MissedUpgradeCall
UncleMario: Uy, [i]anak[/i]! I was just trying to call you earlier, ah! Must've been busy at the counter.
UncleMario: Anyway, good thing you called back — I've got a fresh batch of next-tier stock ready to be bought for your store!
UncleMario: Here's what's newly available: {Global_UpgradeItemsList}
UncleMario: I've got the upgrade package ready for you right now — want to take a look?
- Let's check the store upgrades!
	[signal arg="mario_open_upgrade"]
	UncleMario: That's the spirit! Here's what we've got ready.
- Actually, I just need to restock.
	[signal arg="mario_open_restock"]
	UncleMario: No problem, [i]anak[/i]! Send me your restock list instead.
- Maybe later, Uncle.
	[signal arg="mario_cancel_call"]
	UncleMario: Sige, take your time! Just ring me up whenever you're ready to expand.
[end_timeline]

label StoreUpgradeDelivery
UncleMario: I've upgraded your store! Ingat anak.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label StoreUpgradeAlso
UncleMario: Also...
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label CatUpgradeDelivery1
UncleMario: Look who I found sneaking near my tricycle — this is Mingming!
UncleMario: Neighbors love dropping by when there's a sleepy cat on the shelf. Looks like your counter can handle two customers at once now, anak!
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label CatUpgradeDelivery2
UncleMario: Brought a big bag of premium cat food for Mingming!
UncleMario: A well-fed lucky cat brings the whole barangay to your counter — three neighbors can line up at once now, anak!
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]

label TrashCanUpgradeDelivery
UncleMario: Dropped off a sturdy trash can in the corner for you, anak!
UncleMario: Just toss any extra or unwanted stock right in whenever you need to clear shelf space.
[signal arg="mario_delivery_next"]
[end_timeline]